# CrypTAK: renew vpn.thousand-pikes.com Let's Encrypt cert (DNS-01, idempotent)
# Daily at 03:00 is safe — certbot renew is a no-op outside the renewal window.
# Logs to appdata (cache pool) because /var/log on Unraid is tmpfs and silently
# drops cron stdout/stderr.
#
# Install to: /boot/config/plugins/dynamix/cryptak-renew-cert.cron
#   then run: /usr/local/sbin/update_cron
# See server/scripts/README.md.
0 3 * * * bash /mnt/user/appdata/tak-server/scripts/renew-cert.sh >> /mnt/user/appdata/letsencrypt/renew.log 2>&1
